# Information about `LogL16fromY`

## Function Signature

```c

extern int LogL16fromY(double, int);
```

## Source Code

```c
int LogL16fromY(double Y, int em) /* get 16-bit LogL from Y */
{
  if (Y >= 1.8371976e19)
    return (0x7fff);
  if (Y <= -1.8371976e19)
    return (0xffff);
  if (Y > 5.4136769e-20)
    return tiff_itrunc(256. * (log2(Y) + 64.), em);
  if (Y < -5.4136769e-20)
    return (~0x7fff | tiff_itrunc(256. * (log2(-Y) + 64.), em));
  return (0);
}
```

