# Information about `LogL10toY`

## Function Signature

```c

extern double LogL10toY(int);
```

## Source Code

```c
double
LogL10toY(int p10) /* compute luminance from 10-bit LogL */
{
  if (p10 == 0)
    return (0.);
  return (exp(M_LN2 / 64. * (p10 + .5) - M_LN2 * 12.));
}
```

