# Information about `TIFFYCbCrtoRGB`

## Function Signature

```c

extern void TIFFYCbCrtoRGB(TIFFYCbCrToRGB *, uint32_t, int32_t, int32_t,
                           uint32_t *, uint32_t *, uint32_t *);
```

## Source Code

```c
void TIFFYCbCrtoRGB(TIFFYCbCrToRGB *ycbcr, uint32_t Y, int32_t Cb, int32_t Cr,
                    uint32_t *r, uint32_t *g, uint32_t *b) {
  int32_t i;

  /* XXX: Only 8-bit YCbCr input supported for now */
  Y = HICLAMP(Y, 255);
  Cb = CLAMP(Cb, 0, 255);
  Cr = CLAMP(Cr, 0, 255);

  i = ycbcr->Y_tab[Y] + ycbcr->Cr_r_tab[Cr];
  *r = CLAMP(i, 0, 255);
  i = ycbcr->Y_tab[Y] + (int)((ycbcr->Cb_g_tab[Cb] + ycbcr->Cr_g_tab[Cr]) >> SHIFT);
  *g = CLAMP(i, 0, 255);
  i = ycbcr->Y_tab[Y] + ycbcr->Cb_b_tab[Cb];
  *b = CLAMP(i, 0, 255);
}
```

