2. `TIFFSwabArrayOfDouble`
    Swaps byte order of each `double` in-place for `n` elements. Use it on arrays when TIFF data endianness differs from host. It assumes `sizeof(double)==8`; `n==0` does nothing. Its signature is:
    ```c
    
