    Converts one YCbCr pixel to RGB using precomputed tables in `TIFFYCbCrToRGB`. Pass 8-bit Y/Cb/Cr values and output pointers for r/g/b. Inputs are clamped to 0–255; results are clamped to 0–255. Its signature is:
    ```c
    
extern void TIFFYCbCrtoRGB(TIFFYCbCrToRGB *, uint32_t, int32_t, int32_t,
