    ```c
    
extern tmsize_t TIFFWriteTile(TIFF* tif, void* buf, uint32_t x, uint32_t y, uint32_t z, uint16_t s);
    ```
22. `TIFFSetWriteOffset`
    `TIFFSetWriteOffset` directly sets `tif->tif_curoff`, the current write offset in a `TIFF*`. Use it to adjust where the next write will occur. It has no checks or side effects beyond assigning the offset. Its signature is:
    ```c
