## Target API Functions

1. `TIFFRasterScanlineSize64`
​ Returns the raster scanline size in bytes for the current TIFF directory. Use after tags are set. For PLANARCONFIG_CONTIG it computes width*bits/spp then rounds up to bytes; for separate planes it rounds width*bits to bytes, then multiplies by samples/pixel.
